    "description": "StartFragment\n\n```\n# Mini Shop API\nRESTful API store management system.\n## Base URL\n- **Development:** `http://localhost:8000/api/v1`\n## Authentication\nAPI use Bearer Token (Laravel Sanctum).\nCall `POST /auth/login` to get token and use token for request need verify.\n## Response Format\nEvery response has a structure:\n```json\n{\n    \"success\": true|false,\n    \"message\": \"string\",\n    \"data\": {}\n}\n\n ```\n\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nEndFragment",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52595223",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/52595223-d3c9327e-65bf-420c-94e0-9e88b35d9138?source=collection_link"
